# fixedbugs, defect 2062, lane b17-ffi, 2026-10-14.
#
# SYMPTOM: `fd`, a member of `via`, whose type `union named_u` has a name:
# *declares no `fd`*, its note's two fixes unable to work.
#
# FIX: the note says `fd` is inside `via`, and since its type has a name, one
# more route: that type bound as a record of the group, `via` a field of it.

extern "fixedbugs-2062-records.h"
    record Holds tag holds
        kind: i32
        fd: i32  #~ ffi_unknown_field

function main()
    h = Holds(kind: 2, rest: zero)
    print(h.kind)
